{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"经济系统基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"virtual-economy-principles","title":"虚拟经济设计原则与双货币体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/fundamentals/virtual-economy-principles","wordCount":1274,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"faucet-sink-balance","title":"货币水龙头与水槽","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/fundamentals/faucet-sink-balance","wordCount":760,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"supply-demand-modeling","title":"供需建模与弹性定价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/fundamentals/supply-demand-modeling","wordCount":836,"readingTime":4}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"经济系统基础\">经济系统基础</h1><p>本章建立游戏经济仿真的理论地基。三篇文档分别覆盖虚拟经济的设计原则与双货币体系、货币水龙头与水槽的流量平衡模型、以及供需弹性函数与均衡价格建模。掌握这三个基础后，才能在后续章节正确理解 ABM 和蒙特卡洛仿真的设定依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>虚拟经济设计原则与双货币体系</strong> — 货币体系的设计哲学、软硬货币职责划分、Free-to-Play 经济学的激励结构。</li>\n<li><strong>货币水龙头与水槽</strong> — faucet-sink balance sheet、货币流速控制、稳态条件的数学推导。</li>\n<li><strong>供需建模与弹性定价</strong> — 需求曲线、价格弹性函数、稀缺度参数、均衡价格的数值求解。</li>\n</ol>\n"}